<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - International Game.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - International Game.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of International Game Technology with a near and long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Naomi Talish said later there were four reasons behind the buy rating:</p>
<p>- the company's dominant position in the slot machine industry;</p>
<p>- acceleration of domestic demand for slot machines;</p>
<p>- a more positive international demand picture;</p>
<p>- potential for positive earnings surprises.</p>
</text>
